         -* ICY MAIL #VERSION *-

A modern offline mail reader for BBS systems.

- Written in pure rust
- Multi platform Windows, OSX, Linux
- Reads QWK and Blue Wave mail packets
- Writes REP and NEW reply packets
- Threaded messages, search & unread filters
- ANSI and modern message display
- Replies, drafts, taglines & address book
- Opens compressed packets directly
- 3D accelerated
- Copy & Paste

For latest builds/development visit:
GitHub https://github.com/mkrueger/icy_tools
